  KChess Elite is our most powerful chess program, allowing you to
  take complete control of your chess game. It is ideal for casual
  players, children learning to play chess, and anyone wanting to
  improve their game. KChess Elite has lots of features to help 
  you play. See the pieces that have been taken, where pieces can 
  move, who can take what, which move the computer recommends, the 
  name of the opening (from the Encyclopaedia of Chess Openings), 
  a narration about the relative strength and position of both 
  players, whether checkmate is inevitable, and more. An arrow 
  highlights the last move so you can see clearly what has 
  happened. Set the board to a specific layout, rotate it, enlarge 
  it, change the set of pieces, and even add your own comments to 
  a game.
  
  
  Homepage : http://www.arkangles.com/kchess/elite.html
  

